{"id":3109,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>吕月，预备党员，计算机科学与技术学院计算机科学与技术专业2022级本科生。现已推免至西北大学计算机学院软件工程专业攻读硕士学位。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=snllZanmQ7UNMVob7LsU8W2UzUDnRLEbM7U8U4vDolLbUl70gihFp2hmCIa0okybUYyaMYh7nRnRLmCPnRW2UznRnzTVUzV7UlW2Mll4Mm6FLRQRn77DU4fFoRUbM1b/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/89C07DD4C261D2FA4CE9EA1DABF5E367/06CDA6C0/8496\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 281px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=snllZanmQ7UNMVob7LsU8W2UzUDnRLEbM7U8U4vDolLbUl70gihFp2hmCIa0okybUYyaMYh7nRnRLmCPnRW2UznRnzTVUzV7UlW2Mll4Mm6FLRQRn77DU4fFoRUbM1b/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p>她曾任院团委第二团总支书记，大学期间以“勤学善思、月映初心”为信条，在学业、科研、实践领域稳步前行，平均学分绩点达3.97，稳居专业前5%，凭借扎实的学业表现连续两年斩获专业综合素质一等奖学金，获评校级三好学生，成为同学眼中的“学习标杆”。同时，她在学科竞赛中成果丰硕，斩获高校智能机器人创意大赛、蓝桥杯、大创、刘鼎杯等国家级奖项1项、省级奖项3项、校级奖项数十项，还多次获评校级、院级优秀共青团员，用综合实力诠释了新时代大学生的责任担当。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sL8MZkUzvaoz9bMbRAkM7CaMRM2UzTE7Um9YMR-iLmvaUNL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yYnShRM1yYnRUan7lsL49bMzWVU4lbU8UYL49bnzUDL8QFM7lioR78M4VFLzl4LmNJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F2EC62D40DE738952EC59CD2389E463F/4E581471/15329\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"567\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sL8MZkUzvaoz9bMbRAkM7CaMRM2UzTE7Um9YMR-iLmvaUNL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yYnShRM1yYnRUan7lsL49bMzWVU4lbU8UYL49bnzUDL8QFM7lioR78M4VFLzl4LmNJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p>红心铸信仰，青春显担当</p><p>自入学以来，她以高度政治自觉向党组织靠拢，从入党积极分子成长为预备党员，始终以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想武装头脑，主动参与学院理论学习小组活动，在深学细悟中坚定理想信念。担任学生会骨干期间，牵头规范奖学金评选、团日活动等工作，流程规范严谨，获得师生一致认可；作为共青团河曲县委兼职团干，积极参与“学子归巢”活动，搭建家乡与学子间的人才桥梁；担任多门课程课代表，成为师生沟通的“连心桥”，服务初心落地生根，先后获评院级、校级“优秀共青团员”。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=snzQZVM4GiLNrVLbl-8U4NDnmvPM4GEaoRGDolWkMzCaM870gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRMSh2nSy8nmVfU4T2UmWRUlVRoRNYoRL4nN-4n7UDMlnFU4rVnmNsM8WFUNr7Mkb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7C5FE4F1AC9FB2CAAC892833FB3DD65D/C5EF977B/BED4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"630\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=snzQZVM4GiLNrVLbl-8U4NDnmvPM4GEaoRGDolWkMzCaM870gihFp2hmCIa0MYhRMSh2nSy8nmVfU4T2UmWRUlVRoRNYoRL4nN-4n7UDMlnFU4rVnmNsM8WFUNr7Mkb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sMRMZRLRUPnRN4MbR94Um-Dn77DL4CEPo7UPU8CiM4AkolU0gihFp2hmCIa0nky8nkyPnkhkMmnRMRM7ol-PMlnfoz7PnNCiL46fUzMRL8MFMRfknlM2nlQFUmfVUSb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D4D1DB64C43D9B15DA911FF537AA3C3C/40BECFEF/B0EA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"629\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sMRMZRLRUPnRN4MbR94Um-Dn77DL4CEPo7UPU8CiM4AkolU0gihFp2hmCIa0nky8nkyPnkhkMmnRMRM7ol-PMlnfoz7PnNCiL46fUzMRL8MFMRfknlM2nlQFUmfVUSb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sn77ZbnNM2nNVkUbNV2nzVVLRL8UzlE8U49YUlV2LzlDnmC0gihFp2hmCIa0oky8oShVMSyaMzrRM7WkMmCYMNQfLlUDn7-ZMzv8MmlboRVFLRv4L7UboRMFLzU4M4CJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/849E5055C4BB6626FA1D6DB857465981/0730D983/14376\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sn77ZbnNM2nNVkUbNV2nzVVLRL8UzlE8U49YUlV2LzlDnmC0gihFp2hmCIa0oky8oShVMSyaMzrRM7WkMmCYMNQfLlUDn7-ZMzv8MmlboRVFLRv4L7UboRMFLzU4M4CJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p>学研互促强，赛练展锋芒</p><p>吕月秉持“知行合一”的理念，将理论知识转化为竞赛实力。在2025年中国高校智能机器人创意大赛中，作为视觉系统核心成员攻克环境感知精度难题，优化数据处理与模型参数，助力团队斩获全国一等奖；备战蓝桥杯时，提前半年在AcWing平台坚持“每日编程”，完成200余道题目，获省级二等奖；“工行杯”中，与团队携《e“芯”为你》方案获山西赛区优秀奖；牵头或核心参与的项目获大创省校级立项结题，在“互联网+”“刘鼎杯”等赛事中斩获多项校级奖项；还斩获2023全国大学生办公软件技能大赛初决赛一等奖，尽显综合能力。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=snmVZ7MN-DUm-DUb4GPo7Q2nRUZL7VEfUzGYL4GioznRM7l0gihFp2hmCIa0UYybLkyaoSyiLlVfnRvPUlQ2ozW2LlUiLlnko77bM4-bozVFnzNsLNlZnlWFMNLPMYb/v2rjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpeg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C900951AAD71AFF92F1D51DB8A972991/E972E8EB/6C17\" vheight=\"198\" vwidth=\"264\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=snmVZ7MN-DUm-DUb4GPo7Q2nRUZL7VEfUzGYL4GioznRM7l0gihFp2hmCIa0UYybLkyaoSyiLlVfnRvPUlQ2ozW2LlUiLlnko77bM4-bozVFnzNsLNlZnlWFMNLPMYb/v2rjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sL4NZiMRGbMRLbLb7laMmMVMRNYoR9EsUm9YMml4LmrVL7L0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhRMShVMShRLmA2MzrkL87anR6RLRfkL8Q2U8W2ol7bMmMFnmNsMz62nNWFLzLPLRlJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CC5E5C28F55B3A0D7C00B3FFCBF9A963/F9757FFB/13105\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 478px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sL4NZiMRGbMRLbLb7laMmMVMRNYoR9EsUm9YMml4LmrVL7L0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhRMShVMShRLmA2MzrkL87anR6RLRfkL8Q2U8W2ol7bMmMFnmNsMz62nNWFLzLPLRlJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sLRvZ8U8MRo7WRMblVfUzlZnzn7L7lE8nl-iLmCZM8-4MRC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1h7L1yYMShVnmCPUzV7L87bL4C4LNrVUNlYLzW7LRlsolVFLRr7olnRL8nFnNnVMYb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BD225EF61A1D3A93632EEBE212D0579A/05D9DC3D/FDE7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 557px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sLRvZ8U8MRo7WRMblVfUzlZnzn7L7lE8nl-iLmCZM8-4MRC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1h7L1yYMShVnmCPUzV7L87bL4C4LNrVUNlYLzW7LRlsolVFLRr7olnRL8nFnNnVMYb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sUm9ZsnmAVL494obRvsozvDnRl8Mm7EsMRNYU4T7UzU8ol-0gihFp2hmCIa0UShVnkysU1hknzC4Umn2M4ffLR6RUmU8UznfLRnVLlLYM7QFnNn7LllPU4AFn7Q2U1b/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AED7BBE63B4F70A07CB44A4A04E1C24F/FDD1E1C8/DFFB\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 382px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sUm9ZsnmAVL494obRvsozvDnRl8Mm7EsMRNYU4T7UzU8ol-0gihFp2hmCIa0UShVnkysU1hknzC4Umn2M4ffLR6RUmU8UznfLRnVLlLYM7QFnNn7LllPU4AFn7Q2U1b/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sM7WZRMmvYL4vZnbN-PLll4U8UsLzNEPnz-an7nkM87iLm90gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPUSy8oShVM8-DLzl8Ul-4o77bLNV2L4MVUlW7MRTVUmWFnznkMRTVMRQFLzN8U47Jqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/41A49E7B6154AB38A92AF33EABD49EB2/E4B49E46/194C1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"493\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sM7WZRMmvYL4vZnbN-PLll4U8UsLzNEPnz-an7nkM87iLm90gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPUSy8oShVM8-DLzl8Ul-4o77bLNV2L4MVUlW7MRTVUmWFnznkMRTVMRQFLzN8U47Jqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p>服务有温度，责任践初心</p><p>社会服务中，她坚信优秀大学生需立足社会，目前累计志愿汇时长超200小时。“推普助力乡村振兴”实践中，她所在团队入选2024年国家级志愿服务团队并获“优秀团队”，她深入乡村推广普通话，打破沟通壁垒；作为“一起云支教”骨干志愿者，她连续参与两届“返家乡”活动，以线上辅导为偏远地区学生搭建知识桥梁，获“优秀志愿者”及“寒假社会实践优秀个人”称号；学术服务中，她凭扎实编程基础获评2023年“C语言优秀助教”，用专业能力助力同学成长。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sozLZYnmVRM4VRobRvDoRTfL7r2nRnERM7UbMllYolCio7L0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyYU1y8USyioRVkU8Wkoln7olr2nRr7UlV7ozl4U46foRAFUmTRoz7PUNQFLzGaLl-Jqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E2B4A581BCBB9DD9EFD5DAAD953C7A88/B9C911BF/1001B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"665\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sozLZYnmVRM4VRobRvDoRTfL7r2nRnERM7UbMllYolCio7L0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyYU1y8USyioRVkU8Wkoln7olr2nRr7UlV7ozl4U46foRAFUmTRoz7PUNQFLzGaLl-Jqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sn7UZPnmG4L7QfnbRnRU4QfoRGboRCEaL46fozGYozliUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSybLYyYnky8MR7ZoRTkM4U4L4GDMz-inmT2UzN8L87iL7VFL4lYMz7PnmWFnz94okb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5932D441889B743306525F9FA943A50A/352511F2/E838\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"402\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sn7UZPnmG4L7QfnbRnRU4QfoRGboRCEaL46fozGYozliUl-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSybLYyYnky8MR7ZoRTkM4U4L4GDMz-inmT2UzN8L87iL7VFL4lYMz7PnmWFnz94okb/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sMRvZZLRCPol7iLbzAVoR-iLzMVL87EsUmWRnllDnznVUl70gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYMShkL1h7nmV7olCiU4rRLzCDLzGiM4lPU4WVUN7iLNMFLNWfUllPL8nFLz6VL7LJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B25B2DF1D9F5C5C166105751C2EBA52C/2BAAE13D/17E0C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"692\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=sMRvZZLRCPol7iLbzAVoR-iLzMVL87EsUmWRnllDnznVUl70gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYMShkL1h7nmV7olCiU4rRLzCDLzGiM4lPU4WVUN7iLNMFLNWfUllPL8nFLz6VL7LJqjfjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLRU0Lz7aL4LJqdenx&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg\"></p><p>青春寄语</p><p>大学这段路，或许有迷茫、有疲惫，也有无数个想要放弃的瞬间，但请一定相信，那些默默坚持的日夜、那些认真付出的努力，都不会被辜负，不必急于求成，也不必过分焦虑，慢慢来，稳一点，每一步都算数。</p><p><br></p><p>愿你们始终保持热爱，眼里有光，心中有方向，在该努力的时候不松懈，在该勇敢的时候不退缩，在青春里尽情成长，在未来闪闪发光。</p><p>前路漫漫亦灿灿，祝大家一路披荆斩棘，得偿所愿，奔赴属于自己的万丈光芒。</p><p>栏目简介</p><p>《青春榜样志》聚焦于计算机科学与技术学院涌现出的优秀青年学子，记录他们在学业深耕、科研创新与实践奉献中留下的坚实足迹，展现新时代大学生将个人理想锚定时代需求、勇担使命的昂扬风貌，以榜样之光，照亮更</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://cst.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=snllZanmQ7UNMVob7LsU8W2UzUDnRLEbM7U8U4vDolLbUl70gihFp2hmCIa0okybUYyaMYh7nRnRLmCPnRW2UznRnzTVUzV7UlW2Mll4Mm6FLRQRn77DU4fFoRUbM1b/v2veo4OeCsM8gDTJQty0Lz7aMkyPLzG4LYbw62e8c&oid=1391370217&tid=1104&nid=11033&e=.jpg"}